{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15074","headline":"清明日赐百僚新火 · 韩濬","name":"清明日赐百僚新火","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"御火传香殿，华光及侍臣。\n星流中使马，烛耀九衢人。\n转影连金屋，分辉丽锦茵。\n焰迎红蘂发，烟染绿条春。\n助律和风早，添炉煖气新。\n谁怜一寒士，犹望照东邻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩濬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15074.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15074","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}